b4e3-2cf6-42af-910e-9aa29caa2a70":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Drainage1_1.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"Keeping Floors Dry and Safe","title":"Efficient Liquid Drainage","text":"<p>With their superior slip-resistant and exceptional liquid drainage capabilities, our mats not only enhance safety but also improve overall facility hygiene while providing effective anti-fatigue properties. This ensures a comfortable and safe environment for everyone who steps foot on them.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"db9eb341-6f4e-4210-b819-032d0bc2a54a":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_104_e2729e8f-56bb-43e2-85e4-c3c166f7ea15.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"Anti-fatigue properties","text":"<p>These mats feature anti-fatigue properties and increased comfort underfoot. Boost the morale and health of your patrons and staff with the benefits of anti-fatigue matting.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"right","layout":"right","divider":false}},"37afe09d-e6c1-4ab3-b02e-886b131010a1":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"subtitle":"","title":"simple and effective tiles","text":"<p>Attractive event flooring that is easy to install.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Slate_Black_Tap_Studio.webp","focal_point":"center","layout":"left","height":650,"framed":true,"parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-0":{"type":"heading","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Featured DRAINAGE MATS"}},"template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-1":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":""}}},"block_order":["template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-0","template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"testimonials":{"type":"testimonials","blocks":{"testimonials-0":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}},"testimonials-1":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}},"testimonials-2":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}}},"block_order":["testimonials-0","testimonials-1","testimonials-2"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Testimonials","align_text":"center","round_images":true,"color_background":"#f9f9f9","color_text":"#1c1d1d"}},"8dee5b19-f3b7-478f-9187-7d6dbce1c9ab":{"type":"hero-video","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"SNOW, MUD\n& DAMAGE","title_size":60,"subheading":"CONTAIN THEM WITH THE FLOOR DEFENDER","link_text":"","link":"","color_accent":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_align":"vertical-bottom horizontal-right","video_url":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/205bf0dd43474cadbc436af39a1133dd.mp4","overlay_opacity":0,"section_height":"650px","mobile_height":"auto"}},"f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"REGULAR VS PRO GRADE MATS"}},"template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>The underside of Floor Defender Pro Garage Containment Mats features a tatami grain pattern for increased traction. This patterned backing prevents these mats from lifting and allows them to retain their shape over extended periods of time. Also, the tatami grain patterned backing produces a smoother, less wrinkled surface than the smooth backed regular Floor Defender Garage Containment Mats.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-0","template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"f2f4d304-6a8f-48b3-a6cd-0466dc6e11bd":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_11T09_24_19_294Z.png","image_width":700,"subtitle":"GARAGE FLOOR PROTECTION","title":"NO MUDDY MESS","text":"<p>Dirt, Dust, and Debris are no problem as the Floor Defender Containment Mat catches it all and keeps it from being tracked into the house.<\/p><p>The Floor Defenders will hold up to 62 gallons of water at once and keep it off your floors until you are ready to safely empty it outside your garage.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"12ee58e8-5133-4e52-a73b-887b18d27f7f":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"subtitle":"ROLL OUT AND LAY DOWN","title":"HASSLE-FREE INSTALL","text":"<p>Incredibly easy to use, the floor defenders unlike some other garage containments mats come ready to use. The single piece construction allows you to simply roll the mat out and lay it on your floor.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ezgif.com-gif-maker_8.gif","focal_point":"center","layout":"left","height":550,"framed":false,"parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"9d8d2f29-27b5-4648-b084-5ca9f0b9964b":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_11T09_42_33_705Z.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"Improved","title":"EASY CLEAN UP","text":"<p>Floor defenders are very easy to clean, simply drag the mat outside with all its contents and hose it down. In a matter of minutes, the mat is ready to be redeployed and used all over again.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"49e1522d-4e00-4356-91df-3d3dbada5a3e":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_11T09_45_06_105Z.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"SIMPLE & COMPACT STORAGE","text":"<p>Although the Floor Defender Mats can be used year round, some of our customers prefer to only have the mats out in the winter.<\/p><p>Storing these mats after winter is incredibly easy. Simply roll them back up into a compact size and store it way in your garage.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"e98b186a-cb19-48cb-8775-57d1b1ee5ebe":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"19395395-ab98-4ad2-8cb6-274c48ffe6a1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Featured DRAINAGE MATS"}},"c2c28a4a-2065-470b-9375-0248492fed55":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>Designed to deliver exceptional performance in wet area applications.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["19395395-ab98-4ad2-8cb6-274c48ffe6a1","c2c28a4a-2065-470b-9375-0248492fed55"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"087211cd-4834-4b15-a3b7-d3e07427c582":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14487908515969__087211cd-4834-4b15-a3b7-d3e07427c582-1679382100c0d511da-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/EXTRA-TREAD_A_1080x_427c52ae-5404-4684-8a75-4142eff5b78e.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"HERON RIB FOR POOL APPLICATIONS","text":"<p>The Heron Rib Drainage Mat increases safety in wet areas by providing proper slip resistance and draining large amounts of water. Combined with the soft surface layer, the Heron rib is perfect for bare feet applications. This makes this drainage mat ideal for pools, locker rooms, and showers.<\/p>","button_label":"buy heron rib drainage matting","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/heron-rib-matting"}},"template--14487908515969__087211cd-4834-4b15-a3b7-d3e07427c582-1679382100c0d511da-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_107_41dd2cb2-d95a-4e5c-832a-b8cd75a3392f.png","image_width":650,"title":"VYNAGRIP FOR INDUSTRIAL APPLICATIONS","text":"<p>Vynagrip drainage safety mats are a great way to create a slip resistant floor in any industrial or commercial application. Built from top quality material, the Vynagrip offers a very high slip resistant rating (DIN 51130 - R11) along with a top liquid drainage rating, which meet the highest international standards.<\/p>","button_label":"buy vynagrip safety drainage matting","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/vynagrip-safety-drainage-matting"}},"template--14487908515969__087211cd-4834-4b15-a3b7-d3e07427c582-1679382100c0d511da-2":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image_width":650,"title":"Example title","text":"<p>Use this section to explain a set of product features, to link to a series of pages, or to answer common questions about your products. Add images for emphasis.<\/p>","button_label":"Optional button","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template